{"title":"Pine Tree (Stud)","slug":"Pine_Tree_(Stud)","pageid":4850,"revid":20903,"timestamp":"2025-12-24T15:56:40Z","lastEditor":"AngeloKawasaki","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"title","value":"Pine Tree (Stud)"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.96.0"},{"label":"Status","value":"Unobtainale unless trading"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"obtaining-after-the-event","text":"Obtaining (after the event)"},{"id":"obtaining-during-the-event","text":"Obtaining (during the event)"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>This tree was part of the 2025 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/My_Island_Collab/\">My Island Collab</a>, it resembles the normal trees of said game. It was added alongside 2 other trees: <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tree_of_Doom/\">Tree of Doom</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flower_of_Friendship/\">Flower of Friendship</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"obtaining-after-the-event\">Obtaining (after the event)</h2>\n<p>As of the end of the collab, the tree has become unobtainable via regular means unless trading with other players. Although in the 1.96.0 changelog said the tree's could come back in the future, but nothing more has been said about the matter.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"obtaining-during-the-event\">Obtaining (during the event)</h2>\n<p>The tree will spawn in the main biome (otherwise known as <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay</a>) replacing most oak trees.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: 7748923638 9938675423 1766589991528\">7748923638 9938675423 1766589991528</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: media file\">media file</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RPlank\">RPlank</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n</div>"}
